elpa-welkomscherm (1.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Require Emacs 28.1; the ERT suite does not pass on 27.2.
  * Use an imperative docstring in `welkomscherm/system-description' so the
    checkdoc gate passes on Emacs 30.1.
  * Bump the version to 1.3.1.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 15:20:00 +0100

